{
  "sets": [
    {
      "title": "Set 1: National Affairs, Policy & Governance",
      "questions": [
        {
          "source_id": "1",
          "evidence": "Out of 14,81,310 entries in the voter list, there are a total of 158 entries in which the names of the voters or their relatives appear strange.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "According to the statement released by the Chief Electoral Officer of Uttar Pradesh, out of nearly 14.8 million entries in the voter list, how many entries featured strange names for voters or relatives?",
            "hi": "उत्तर प्रदेश के मुख्य निर्वाचन अधिकारी द्वारा जारी बयान के अनुसार, मतदाता सूची में लगभग 14.8 मिलियन प्रविष्टियों में से कितनी प्रविष्टियों में मतदाताओं या उनके रिश्तेदारों के नाम अजीब दिखाई दिए?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "1,580 entries",
                "hi": "1,580 प्रविष्टियाँ"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "158 entries",
                "hi": "158 प्रविष्टियाँ"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "15,800 entries",
                "hi": "15,800 प्रविष्टियाँ"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "15 entries",
                "hi": "15 प्रविष्टियाँ"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "b",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The official statement noted that out of 14,81,310 total entries, precisely 158 entries contained strange names due to initial compilation errors.",
            "hi": "आधिकारिक बयान में उल्लेख किया गया है कि 14,81,310 कुल प्रविष्टियों में से ठीक 158 प्रविष्टियों में प्रारंभिक संकलन त्रुटियों के कारण अजीब नाम थे।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "2",
          "evidence": "Organised by the Disha Students’ Organisation and Bhagat Singh Jan Adhikar Yatra (BSJAY), the demonstration also called for the repeal of the 2023 law governing the appointment of Election Commissioners",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "The student demonstration at Mumbai University organised by the Disha Students’ Organisation and BSJAY called for the repeal of which legislation?",
            "hi": "दिशा स्टूडेंट्स ऑर्गनाइजेशन और बीएसजेएवाई द्वारा मुंबई विश्वविद्यालय में आयोजित छात्र प्रदर्शन में किस कानून को निरस्त करने की मांग की गई?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "The 2023 law governing the appointment of Election Commissioners",
                "hi": "चुनाव आयुक्तों की नियुक्ति को नियंत्रित करने वाला 2023 का कानून"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "The 2021 Electoral Bonds Amendment Act",
                "hi": "2021 का चुनावी बॉन्ड संशोधन अधिनियम"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "The 2022 Delimitation Commission Act",
                "hi": "2022 का परिसीमन आयोग अधिनियम"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "The 2024 Voter Verification Act",
                "hi": "2024 का मतदाता सत्यापन अधिनियम"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The demonstration explicitly called for the repeal of the specific 2023 law governing how Election Commissioners are appointed.",
            "hi": "प्रदर्शन में विशेष रूप से चुनाव आयुक्तों की नियुक्ति को विनियमित करने वाले 2023 के कानून को निरस्त करने की मांग की गई।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "3",
          "evidence": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi will present the award at the concluding ceremony of the singer's year-long birth centenary celebrations at Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi on November 29, says CM Sarma",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "Where is the concluding ceremony of the year-long birth centenary celebrations of the singer scheduled to be held on November 29?",
            "hi": "29 नवंबर को गायिका की वर्ष भर चलने वाली जन्म शताब्दी समारोह का समापन समारोह कहाँ आयोजित किया जाना है?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Vigyan Bhavan, New Delhi",
                "hi": "विज्ञान भवन, नई दिल्ली"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi",
                "hi": "नई दिल्ली में भारत मंडपम"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Guwahati University, Assam",
                "hi": "गुवाहाटी विश्वविद्यालय, असम"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Rabindra Sadan, Kolkata",
                "hi": "रवींद्र सदन, कोलकाता"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "b",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "Chief Minister Sarma noted that the event will take place at Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi.",
            "hi": "मुख्यमंत्री सरमा ने उल्लेख किया कि यह कार्यक्रम नई दिल्ली के भारत मंडपम में आयोजित होगा।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "4",
          "evidence": "On October 17, a stampede broke out at a Durga Puja pandal in north Kolkata, claiming 19 lives. The pandal, erected in a narrow space with dim lighting, was filled with people soon after it started raining.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "How many lives were claimed in the stampede that broke out at a Durga Puja pandal in north Kolkata on October 17?",
            "hi": "17 अक्टूबर को उत्तर कोलकाता के एक दुर्गा पूजा पंडाल में मची भगदड़ में कितने लोगों की जान चली गई?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "19 lives",
                "hi": "19 लोगों की"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "12 lives",
                "hi": "12 लोगों की"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "25 lives",
                "hi": "25 लोगों की"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "9 lives",
                "hi": "9 लोगों की"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The tragic incident in the narrow, dimly lit pandal caused 19 fatalities.",
            "hi": "तंग और कम रोशनी वाले पंडाल में हुई इस दुखद घटना में 19 मौतें हुईं।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "5",
          "evidence": "Legal action will be taken against both the current and former election officials responsible for the discrepancies found in the voter list for constituency 127 – Pilibhit, reads an official statement by the State election commission",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "For which specific constituency did the State election commission order legal action against officials due to voter list discrepancies?",
            "hi": "मतदाता सूची में विसंगति के कारण राज्य चुनाव आयोग ने किस विशिष्ट निर्वाचन क्षेत्र के अधिकारियों के खिलाफ कानूनी कार्रवाई का आदेश दिया?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Constituency 101 – Lucknow",
                "hi": "निर्वाचन क्षेत्र 101 – लखनऊ"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Constituency 115 – Varanasi",
                "hi": "निर्वाचन क्षेत्र 115 – वाराणसी"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Constituency 127 – Pilibhit",
                "hi": "निर्वाचन क्षेत्र 127 – पीलीभीत"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Constituency 142 – Kanpur",
                "hi": "निर्वाचन क्षेत्र 142 – कानपुर"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "c",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The State election commission's official statement explicitly cited constituency 127 – Pilibhit for the voter list irregularities.",
            "hi": "राज्य चुनाव आयोग के आधिकारिक बयान में मतदाता सूची की अनियमितताओं के लिए विशेष रूप से निर्वाचन क्षेत्र 127 - पीलीभीत का हवाला दिया गया।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "11",
          "evidence": "Periodic Labour Force Survey will include additional questions to measure labour underutilisation",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "What specific aspect does the Periodic Labour Force Survey aim to measure by introducing additional questions?",
            "hi": "आवधिक श्रम बल सर्वेक्षण (Periodic Labour Force Survey) अतिरिक्त प्रश्न शामिल करके किस विशिष्ट पहलू को मापने का लक्ष्य रखता है?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Labour underutilisation",
                "hi": "श्रम अल्पउपयोग (Labour underutilisation)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Industrial productivity output",
                "hi": "औद्योगिक उत्पादकता आउटपुट"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Inflation expectations",
                "hi": "मुद्रास्फीति की उम्मीदें"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Rural agricultural income",
                "hi": "ग्रामीण कृषि आय"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The government is modifying the labour survey to capture elements like the gig economy and unpaid household workers in order to measure labour underutilisation.",
            "hi": "सरकार श्रम अल्पउपयोग को मापने के लिए गिग इकोनॉमी और अवैतनिक घरेलू कामगारों जैसे तत्वों को शामिल करने हेतु श्रम सर्वेक्षण में संशोधन कर रही है।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "15",
          "evidence": "Every cetacean in India is protected under Schedule I of the Wildlife (Protection) Act 1972, which is the same level of protection accorded to tigers and lions.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "Under which schedule of the Wildlife (Protection) Act 1972 are all cetaceans protected in India, matching the protection level of tigers and lions?",
            "hi": "वन्यजीव (संरक्षण) अधिनियम 1972 की किस अनुसूची के तहत भारत में सभी सेटेशियंस (cetaceans) को संरक्षित किया गया है, जो बाघों और शेरों के समान स्तर प्रदान करता है?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Schedule II",
                "hi": "अनुसूची II"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Schedule III",
                "hi": "अनुसूची III"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Schedule I",
                "hi": "अनुसूची I"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Schedule IV",
                "hi": "अनुसूची IV"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "c",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "Every cetacean in India falls under Schedule I, ensuring the highest level of legal protection equivalent to apex cats like tigers and lions.",
            "hi": "भारत में प्रत्येक सेटेशियन अनुसूची I के अंतर्गत आता है, जो बाघों और शेरों जैसी शीर्ष बिल्लियों के बराबर कानूनी संरक्षण का उच्चतम स्तर सुनिश्चित करता है।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "18",
          "evidence": "Half a dozen elite British schools are chasing growth in India amid a boom in its wealthy population.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "What is driving half a dozen elite British schools to expand their presence into India?",
            "hi": "आधा दर्जन संभ्रांत ब्रिटिश स्कूलों को भारत में अपनी उपस्थिति का विस्तार करने के लिए क्या प्रेरित कर रहा है?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "A boom in India's wealthy population",
                "hi": "भारत की संपन्न आबादी में उछाल"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Subsidized land grants offered by state governments",
                "hi": "राज्य सरकारों द्वारा दी जाने वाली सब्सिडीयुक्त भूमि अनुदान"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Mandatory curriculum tie-ups required by local education boards",
                "hi": "स्थानीय शिक्षा बोर्डों द्वारा आवश्यक अनिवार्य पाठ्यक्रम टाई-अप"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Free-of-cost infrastructure provided under bilateral trade deals",
                "hi": "द्विपक्षीय व्यापार समझौतों के तहत प्रदान किया जाने वाला मुफ्त बुनियादी ढांचा"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "Elite British schools are seeking growth and profits in India specifically due to the expanding wealthy demographic.",
            "hi": "कुलीन ब्रिटिश स्कूल विशेष रूप से बढ़ते हुए समृद्ध जनसांख्यिकी के कारण भारत में विकास और लाभ की तलाश कर रहे हैं।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "22",
          "evidence": "V Harish, who ran the hugely popular Instagram account \"Finance with Harish\", was found dead on Tuesday.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "What was the name of the popular Instagram account run by V Harish, who was found dead on Tuesday?",
            "hi": "वी हरीश द्वारा संचालित लोकप्रिय इंस्टाग्राम अकाउंट का नाम क्या था, जिन्हें मंगलवार को मृत पाया गया?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Finance with Harish",
                "hi": "फाइनेंस विद हरीश"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Harish Wealth Builder",
                "hi": "हरीश वेल्थ बिल्डर"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Indian Finance Hub",
                "hi": "इंडियन फाइनेंस हब"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Money Matters Harish",
                "hi": "मनी मैटर्स हरीश"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "V Harish operated the well-known Instagram handle titled 'Finance with Harish'.",
            "hi": "वी हरीश 'फाइनेंस विद हरीश' नामक प्रसिद्ध इंस्टाग्राम हैंडल का संचालन करते थे।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "25",
          "evidence": "The chancellor will unveil AI spending aimed at shoring up the UK's defences in Wednesday's Budget.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "In the UK Budget, the chancellor announced spending aimed at what specific technological defence?",
            "hi": "यूके के बजट में, चांसलर ने किस विशिष्ट तकनीकी सुरक्षा के उद्देश्य से खर्च की घोषणा की?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "AI Biosecurity Lab",
                "hi": "एआई बायोसुरक्षा लैब"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Quantum Encryption Grid",
                "hi": "क्वांटम एन्क्रिप्शन ग्रिड"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "Autonomous Drone Fleet",
                "hi": "स्वायत्त ड्रोन बेड़ा"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "National Cyber Firewall",
                "hi": "राष्ट्रीय साइबर फ़ायरवॉल"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "The Chancellor's budget included funding dedicated to a world-first AI Biosecurity Lab to strengthen national defenses.",
            "hi": "चांसलर के बजट में राष्ट्रीय सुरक्षा को मजबूत करने के लिए दुनिया की पहली एआई बायोसिक्योरिटी लैब को समर्पित फंडिंग शामिल थी।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "36",
          "evidence": "One person is killed and five wounded in a series of attacks. The suspected gunman has been apprehended.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "Following a deadly shooting near Paris, how many casualties were officially reported in the attacks?",
            "hi": "पेरिस के पास एक घातक गोलीबारी के बाद, हमलों में आधिकारिक तौर पर कितने हताहत होने की सूचना मिली थी?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "One person killed and five wounded",
                "hi": "एक व्यक्ति मारा गया और पांच घायल हुए"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Two persons killed and three wounded",
                "hi": "दो लोग मारे गए और तीन घायल हुए"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "text": {
                "en": "No deaths and ten wounded",
                "hi": "कोई मौत नहीं और दस घायल"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": {
                "en": "Four persons killed and eight wounded",
                "hi": "चार लोग मारे गए और आठ घायल हुए"
              }
            }
          ],
          "correct_option_id": "a",
          "explanation": {
            "en": "President Macron addressed the attack where one individual was killed and five others sustained injuries.",
            "hi": "राष्ट्रपति मैक्रोन ने उस हमले को संबोधित किया जिसमें एक व्यक्ति मारा गया और पांच अन्य घायल हो गए।"
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "37",
          "evidence": "Thirty-four people are also injured in the attack in southern Karak governorate, and a manhunt is now under way.",
          "prompt": {
            "en": "In which southern governorate of Jordan did gunmen carry out a shooting attack at a church funeral?",
            "hi": "जॉर्डन के किस दक्षिणी गवर्नरट में बंदूकधारियों ने चर्च के अंतिम संस्कार में गोलीबारी की?"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": {
                "en": "Karak governorate",
                "hi": "करक गवर्नरट"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "text": {
                "en": "Amman governorate",
                "hi": "अम्मान गवर्नरट"
              }
